{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:2ff1993852ba9dc7","name":"Rebel Assault Frigate Mark II","source":{"id":"source:reference-2ff1993852ba9dc7","title":"Rebel Assault Frigate Mark II","revision":18779,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:43:17Z","sha256":"1a8d2f51de434aaec447ed19b23d69bae49d0346f99b7aa12fa62cb6efcbfcec","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18779","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Rebel%20Assault%20Frigate%20Mark%20II&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-2ff1993852ba9dc7","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Rebel Assault Frigate Mark II is a further development of the Alliance project to modify captured or salvaged ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Dreadnaught"]},"-Class Heavy Cruisers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dreadnaught-Class_Heavy_Cruisers"},". Although the Mark II uses the same ",{"tag":"i","children":["Dreadnaught"]}," hull as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebel Assault Frigate Mark I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebel_Assault_Frigate_Mark_I","referenceId":"reference:058b352dff466cfd"},", it looks vastly different from its cousin. Only experienced ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," engineers who know what to look for can tell that the two ships are related.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebel Assault Frigate Mark I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebel_Assault_Frigate_Mark_I","referenceId":"reference:058b352dff466cfd"}," retained a good deal of the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Dreadnaught's"]}," hull design, the Mark II is a much more original design. The design was produced by engineers and technicians within Rendili Star Drive who were sympathetic to the cause of the Alliance. Working in secrecy, they took the original frigate several steps beyond the Alliance's vision. Unfortunately for the effort, Rendili Star Drive caught wind of the covert project and shut it down from the inside out. Many of these rogue engineers were killed or captured, but a few managed to defect to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"},". As a result, the Alliance Fleet has far fewer Rebel Assault Frigate Mark IIs than ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebel Assault Frigates Mark I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebel_Assault_Frigates_Mark_I"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Like the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebel Assault Frigate Mark I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebel_Assault_Frigate_Mark_I","referenceId":"reference:058b352dff466cfd"},", the Mk II uses a large array of automated ship systems, reducing its reliance on organic crewmen by an additional 180. Aside from the external differences between the Mark I and the Mark II, one other significant change sets the Mark II apart: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Regenerating Shields"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Regenerating_Shields","referenceId":"reference:2e77755f19ed1cf7"}," based on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"}," designs. This feature allows the Rebel Assault Frigate Mark II to regenerate its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," at twice the normal rate, increasing it by 10 for every action of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Recharge Shields"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Recharge_Shields","referenceId":"reference:d4549c92a68a5d8a"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Rebel Assault Frigate Mark II Statistics (CL 17)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal (Cruiser) ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -2; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 16 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 13), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 52; +13 Armor\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 1,500; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 20; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},": 150 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Regenerating Shields"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Regenerating_Shields","referenceId":"reference:2e77755f19ed1cf7"},"); ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 252\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Offense"